WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
GUYS! WAKE UP! WHERE THE HELL ARE WE?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.224
WHAT IS THAT?!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.016
That's an entire army!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.480
Wait… they're coming straight toward us.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.344
THE KINGDOM WILL FALL BEFORE SUNSET!

00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:17.136
THE CITY GATE! YOU MUST REACH IT!

00:00:17.336 --> 00:00:18.656
THEN LET'S MOVE!

00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:21.376
RONALDO! STOP! THE BRIDGE IS BROKEN!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.592
GUYS! ARCHERS!

00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:26.472
GET DOWN! NOW!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.320
They saw us!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.592
Wait… look at this.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.912
What is it?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.360
These symbols… they look like US.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.736
That's impossible.

00:00:38.936 --> 00:00:40.688
THERE! AN ENTRANCE!

00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:42.280
GO! GO! GO!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.512
GUYS! I'M STUCK!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.656
OhBhai… Ronaldo… Messi…

00:00:53.856 --> 00:00:56.184
HOW DOES HE KNOW OUR NAMES?

00:00:56.384 --> 00:00:59.720
YOU ARE 4,000 YEARS LATE.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
TO BE CONTINUED…

